INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(327,'Fix Apple iPhone 6 (2014): Battery drains quickly','The Apple iPhone 6 (2014) loses its charge within a few hours of light use and shuts down unexpectedly below 20%.','1. Open Settings > Battery and check which apps use the most power.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(328,'Fix Apple iPhone 6s Plus (2015): Stuck on the boot logo / restart loop','The Apple iPhone 6s Plus (2015) freezes on the brand logo or keeps rebooting and never reaches the home screen.','1. Force restart by holding Power + Volume Down for 10 seconds.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(329,'Fix Apple iPad Air 2 (2014): Will not charge past 1%','The Apple iPad Air 2 (2014) plugs in but the battery icon stays at 0-1 percent or shows a charging error.','1. Clean the charging port with a wooden pick and compressed air.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(330,'Fix Apple iPad mini 2 (2013): Touchscreen not responding','Taps and swipes on the Apple iPad mini 2 (2013) are ignored, mostly after a fall.','1. Force restart and hold Power + Home for 15 seconds.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(331,'Fix Apple MacBook Pro 13-inch Mid 2012: Not charging / no power light','The Apple MacBook Pro 13-inch Mid 2012 shows no charging LED and does not power on with the adapter connected.','1. Test the adapter on another laptop and check the pin for damage.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(332,'Fix Apple MacBook Air 11-inch Early 2015: Fan noise and overheating','The Apple MacBook Air 11-inch Early 2015 runs loud, gets hot near the vents and throttles under load.','1. Clear the vents with compressed air and never block them on a bed or pillow.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(333,'Fix Apple Watch Series 1 (2016): Will not pair with the phone','The Apple Watch Series 1 (2016) cannot be found in Bluetooth settings or pairing always fails.','1. Turn Bluetooth off and on again on the phone, then restart the watch.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(334,'Fix Apple AirPods 1st generation (2016): Sound only in one ear','One side of the Apple AirPods 1st generation (2016) is silent or cuts in and out when the cable moves.','1. Clean the driver mesh and ear tips of wax and debris.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(335,'Fix Apple TV HD (2015): Sound but no picture','The Apple TV HD (2015) plays audio but the screen stays black or very dim.','1. Cover the room - an image may be visible, pointing to backlight failure.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(336,'Fix Apple iMac 21.5-inch Late 2013: Powers on but no display','The Apple iMac 21.5-inch Late 2013 fans spin and lights come on, but the monitor stays black.','1. Reseat the RAM and the graphics card.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(337,'Fix Samsung Galaxy S5 (2014): Touchscreen dead zones','Parts of the Samsung Galaxy S5 (2014) screen ignore taps or respond late, usually after a drop or moisture exposure.','1. Remove the screen protector and case, then clean the glass.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(338,'Fix Samsung Galaxy Note 4 (2014): Overheating while charging','The Samsung Galaxy Note 4 (2014) gets very hot during charging or camera use and slows down.','1. Use only the original charger and cable.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(339,'Fix Samsung Galaxy S III (2012): Battery drains quickly','The Samsung Galaxy S III (2012) loses its charge within a few hours of light use and shuts down unexpectedly below 20%.','1. Open Settings > Battery and check which apps use the most power.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(340,'Fix Samsung Galaxy J7 (2016): Stuck on the boot logo / restart loop','The Samsung Galaxy J7 (2016) freezes on the brand logo or keeps rebooting and never reaches the home screen.','1. Force restart by holding Power + Volume Down for 10 seconds.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(341,'Fix Samsung Galaxy S8 (2017): Touchscreen dead zones','Parts of the Samsung Galaxy S8 (2017) screen ignore taps or respond late, usually after a drop or moisture exposure.','1. Remove the screen protector and case, then clean the glass.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(342,'Fix Samsung Galaxy Tab A 9.7 (2015): Wi-Fi keeps disconnecting','The Samsung Galaxy Tab A 9.7 (2015) drops the Wi-Fi connection while other devices stay online.','1. Forget the network, reboot the router and reconnect.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(343,'Fix Samsung SyncMaster S22B350 (2012): Monitor stays black','The Samsung SyncMaster S22B350 (2012) powers on with an LED but shows no picture at all.','1. Press the input/source button to select the correct input.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(344,'Fix Samsung Gear S2 (2015): Battery no longer holds a charge','The Samsung Gear S2 (2015) runs for less than a few hours and dies before the end of the day.','1. Reduce screen brightness and disable always-on display.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(345,'Fix Samsung Galaxy Buds (2019): Will not hold a charge','The Samsung Galaxy Buds (2019) dies within minutes even after a full charge cycle.','1. Clean the charging contacts with a dry cotton swab.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(346,'Fix Samsung UN40H6350 Smart TV (2014): Apps freeze or crash','Apps on the Samsung UN40H6350 Smart TV (2014) hang, crash back to the home screen or never load.','1. Clear the app cache and data from settings.
