INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(352,'Fix Xiaomi Mi Band 2 (2016): Charger not recognised','The Xiaomi Mi Band 2 (2016) does not light up or charge on its original dock.','1. Clean the magnetic contacts and pins with a dry cloth.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(353,'Fix Xiaomi Redmi AirDots (2019): Pairing fails or drops','The Xiaomi Redmi AirDots (2019) disappears from the device list or will not complete pairing.','1. Forget the device on the phone, then restart both devices.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(354,'Fix Xiaomi Mi Router 3C (2017): No internet but Wi-Fi is connected','Devices join the Xiaomi Mi Router 3C (2017) network but pages will not load.','1. Restart the modem and the router in that order.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(355,'Fix Xiaomi Mi TV 4A 43-inch (2018): Cannot connect to Wi-Fi','The Xiaomi Mi TV 4A 43-inch (2018) will not see or join the home wireless network.','1. Restart the router and move it closer to the TV.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(356,'Fix Xiaomi Mi Notebook Air 13.3 (2016): Extremely slow boot and apps','The Xiaomi Mi Notebook Air 13.3 (2016) takes many minutes to boot and applications hang constantly.','1. Run Disk Cleanup and remove startup programs you do not need.
