INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(364,'Fix Huawei Watch GT (2018): Will not pair with the phone','The Huawei Watch GT (2018) cannot be found in Bluetooth settings or pairing always fails.','1. Turn Bluetooth off and on again on the phone, then restart the watch.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(365,'Fix Huawei FreeBuds 3 (2019): Distortion at higher volume','The Huawei FreeBuds 3 (2019) crackles or sounds muffled when the volume goes up.','1. Lower the source volume and disable any equaliser boosts.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(366,'Fix Huawei MateBook D (2018): Keyboard or trackpad not responding','Some keys on the Huawei MateBook D (2018) stop working or the cursor jumps without input.','1. Clean between the keys with compressed air.
