INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(611,'Fix Baseus 36W Car Charger (2019): Connector loose or sparking','The Baseus 36W Car Charger (2019) falls out of the port or crackles while charging.','1. Stop using the cable - a loose connection can overheat the port.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(612,'Fix Baseus Bass Line Bluetooth Speaker (2018): Sound only in one ear','One side of the Baseus Bass Line Bluetooth Speaker (2018) is silent or cuts in and out when the cable moves.','1. Clean the driver mesh and ear tips of wax and debris.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(613,'Fix Baseus H1 Wireless Headphones (2019): Will not hold a charge','The Baseus H1 Wireless Headphones (2019) dies within minutes even after a full charge cycle.','1. Clean the charging contacts with a dry cotton swab.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(614,'Fix Baseus USB 3.0 4-Port Hub (2018): Double clicks on a single press','The Baseus USB 3.0 4-Port Hub (2018) registers two clicks or scrolls the wrong way.','1. Clean around the buttons and the scroll wheel with compressed air.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(615,'Fix Baseus Aluminum Laptop Stand (2019): Lag, ghosting or stutter','The Baseus Aluminum Laptop Stand (2019) hesitates, jumps or stops responding for a moment.','1. Use the direct port on the back of the PC, not the front panel.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(616,'Fix Baseus USB-C Multiport Adapter (2019): Keys or buttons not responding','Some keys on the Baseus USB-C Multiport Adapter (2019) need repeated presses or never register.','1. Clean under the keycaps with compressed air.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(617,'Fix UGREEN 65W GaN Charger (2020): Power bank will not charge','The UGREEN 65W GaN Charger (2020) does not accept a charge or its LEDs flash and stop.','1. Hold the power button for 10 seconds to wake the circuit.
