INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(633,'Fix Logitech Z623 Speakers (2011): Pairing fails or drops','The Logitech Z623 Speakers (2011) disappears from the device list or will not complete pairing.','1. Forget the device on the phone, then restart both devices.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(634,'Fix Logitech G430 Surround Headset (2014): Distortion at higher volume','The Logitech G430 Surround Headset (2014) crackles or sounds muffled when the volume goes up.','1. Lower the source volume and disable any equaliser boosts.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(635,'Fix Logitech Harmony 650 Remote (2010): Double clicks on a single press','The Logitech Harmony 650 Remote (2010) registers two clicks or scrolls the wrong way.','1. Clean around the buttons and the scroll wheel with compressed air.
