INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(646,'Fix JBL Playlist Speaker (2016): Will not hold a charge','The JBL Playlist Speaker (2016) dies within minutes even after a full charge cycle.','1. Clean the charging contacts with a dry cotton swab.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(647,'Fix Sony Xperia Z3 (2014): Battery drains quickly','The Sony Xperia Z3 (2014) loses its charge within a few hours of light use and shuts down unexpectedly below 20%.','1. Open Settings > Battery and check which apps use the most power.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(648,'Fix Sony Xperia Z5 (2015): Stuck on the boot logo / restart loop','The Sony Xperia Z5 (2015) freezes on the brand logo or keeps rebooting and never reaches the home screen.','1. Force restart by holding Power + Volume Down for 10 seconds.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(649,'Fix Sony Xperia M4 Aqua (2015): Touchscreen dead zones','Parts of the Sony Xperia M4 Aqua (2015) screen ignore taps or respond late, usually after a drop or moisture exposure.','1. Remove the screen protector and case, then clean the glass.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(650,'Fix Sony Xperia L (2013): Overheating while charging','The Sony Xperia L (2013) gets very hot during charging or camera use and slows down.','1. Use only the original charger and cable.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(651,'Fix Sony WH-1000XM2 (2017): Pairing fails or drops','The Sony WH-1000XM2 (2017) disappears from the device list or will not complete pairing.','1. Forget the device on the phone, then restart both devices.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(652,'Fix Sony MDR-EX155 In-Ear Earphones (2014): Distortion at higher volume','The Sony MDR-EX155 In-Ear Earphones (2014) crackles or sounds muffled when the volume goes up.','1. Lower the source volume and disable any equaliser boosts.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(653,'Fix Sony Alpha a5100 (2014): Will not power on','The Sony Alpha a5100 (2014) is completely dead with batteries or the pack fitted.','1. Test the batteries in another device or use a fresh set.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(654,'Fix Sony Alpha a6000 (2014): Memory card not recognised','The Sony Alpha a6000 (2014) reports no card, cannot format or refuses to save images.','1. Try another card - older cameras cap out at 32GB and Class 10.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(655,'Fix Sony PlayStation Vita (2011): Buttons or sticks drifting','Characters move or menus jump without touching the Sony PlayStation Vita (2011) controls.','1. Recalibrate the stick from the settings menu.
INSERT INTO "techfix_solution" VALUES(656,'Fix Sony KDL-40R355 (2014): Apps freeze or crash','Apps on the Sony KDL-40R355 (2014) hang, crash back to the home screen or never load.','1. Clear the app cache and data from settings.
